  "steps": [
    "Cut one 4-position header_long section, with equal 6.25 mm ends, and push out the two end pins (1, 4); keep the full plastic strip.",
    "Pass 2 wires up through the rear opening before crimping. Crimp one socket per wire and insert the sockets into the backs of the housings until latched.",
    "Mate the housing with the rear 6.25 mm pin ends, then lower the header and housing into their seats. The equal front ends face the front opening.",
    "Check that the wires move freely through the rear opening and the contacts remain recessed inside the front edge."
  ],
